OL,3,GNEWSADanone bB,1bn takeover of Huel
OL,4,Aapproved by watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FDanone's takeover of the British meal
OL,7,Fsupplement maker Huel has been cleared
OL,8,Fby the competition watchdog.
OL,10,FThe Competition and Markets Authority
OL,11,F(CMA) has given the bB,1bn (#864m) deal
OL,12,Fthe green light following a review.
OL,14,FHuel, based in Hertfordshire, was
OL,15,Ffounded by Julian Hearn in 2015 to
OL,16,Fprovide nutritionally complete food
OL,17,Fproducts, aimed at reducing meal times
OL,18,Fand providing essential nutrients.
