OL,3,GNEWSADanone bB,1bn takeover of Huel
OL,4,Aapproved by watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe French food and drink firm said the
OL,7,Facquisition will help it grow in the
OL,8,Fnutrition sector, while for Huel it
OL,9,Fwill help the brand's growth ambitions
OL,10,Fand drive its international expansion.
